  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-pumpkin-patch-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "581cb8b0da9b9b94333bbc94246ba4d221c986b46424502f4423cb6a3bc83462",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3f7dee08ec55a3f9d0a090115cc3f977c336d546e992561b799a37c2780858a3",
      "text": "悟空逛南瓜农场",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "daf5866d7b50734c87ca51f8292d77b613308eff2b9485a367d843a159054b38",
      "text": "悟空、敖丙和哪吒\n来到农场。\n四周长满了高高的玉米。\n“是玉米迷宫！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a682fa6cfd87befd35558587620c6d8118c581095a6a0fcb7cce947009fd547c",
      "text": "唐僧指着迷宫说：\n“南瓜田在迷宫的尽头。\n到了稻草人，往左拐；\n到了南瓜堆，往右拐。”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2a2b4b1781bb56480652cd85beb6a9e823078b60d9868e71712a9ce50a1210e",
      "text": "哪吒第一个冲进去。\n他往右拐，又往左拐，\n再往右拐。\n“走这边！”他大喊。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29dd8cf904296455bd291da162e1b6a7dfd42461f32c979fd70d0dd60e52581f",
      "text": "他们绕呀绕呀，\n钻出来一看……\n又回到了入口！\n唐僧笑着说：“又见面啦！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bfce5f87744497b968ecac5051f628323ea201ba2697a21b36704a9cc64ca7cb",
      "text": "敖丙想到一个办法：\n“我们找找路上的标记吧。”\n他们往前直走，\n慢慢地走。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "04515031f6176eb6487df81912bfae05fa4d12542a1969384c67aee817cc3255",
      "text": "稻草人就在他们前面。\n悟空说：“到了稻草人，\n往左拐！”\n大家一起往左拐。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9fc023c6e4b51d87ed22bd4b231033b10f3ed1959a818bcc21343af6f7ee8bc2",
      "text": "左边是玉米，\n右边也是玉米，\n小路在中间。\n敖丙说：“往前直走。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a07c76fe96dbf27f38d069126167207080da5f0dc7827fe2d6a33da6a3f8db87",
      "text": "小路旁边停着\n一辆小红拖拉机。\n哪吒问：“这是南瓜堆吗？”\n“不是，是拖拉机！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3e095ff533beca894266051896f10ed0c568b75c62ab2fe26937f4a335c1282f",
      "text": "拖拉机后面，\n他们找到一堆南瓜。\n“到了南瓜堆，往右拐！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c34f375bb3bcdbb2e8d29109c1459ed32a15d73fc535a47f8e982a1abab6340c",
      "text": "哪吒想往左边跑，\n他停下来，听一听。\n然后和朋友们一起\n往右拐。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "791c7311910181af1742322e3a553605fd80c389193598ea1a7374199112b09f",
      "text": "小路拐了一个弯，\n绕过墙角，\n他们听见前面\n有人在笑。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c28a747d9cf7283e6f2cef4c2303e43181829150f5cdcd6009ff2f838eba831a",
      "text": "悟空从两根玉米秆\n中间探头一看——\n橙色！到处都是橙色！\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d85e4a6c311f9f7c2bab7dd661c181321dc39c9bd0cd40749e84c26b56951251",
      "text": "他们走出迷宫，\n来到南瓜田。\n“我们做到了！”\n迷宫已经在他们身后了。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d566bfaf21ef562c8199926ceb32c0488cdd2ec69eeb1730ad46057b6f79b08b",
      "text": "悟空挑了大叶子旁边的一个。\n敖丙挑了两根藤中间的一个。\n哪吒挑了稻草人后面的一个。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "afc59586331e4482728306c982f110757a9f2d55f88180b8dcca3d8c400008df",
      "text": "坐在干草车上，\n三个南瓜排成一排。\n唐僧问：“回家往哪边走？”\n大家一起喊：“往前直走！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
