    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0732f32f80f590cb642772f59f9410eb9131771b1a893ad1eaee1388070f07e6",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n到了稻草人，往左拐；\n到了南瓜堆，往右拐。\n你会往哪边走？\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
